From: Justin Michaud <jmichaud@igalia.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 15:09:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [armv7] Remove ARMv7 JIT support
 https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=320416

Reviewed by Yusuke Suzuki.

ARMv7 runs on CLoop now. We remove all 32-bit jit
references, and some dangling x86 references too.

Canonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/318389@main
